  <item>
    <title>E04：中式家庭的爱=拌着玻璃渣的饭</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674b9d300ed328720a88e348</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674b9d300ed328720a88e348</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Dec 2024 00:18:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>东亚家庭中的爱与控制如同一碗拌了玻璃渣的饭，虽提供成长所需的养料，却把孩子伤的血肉模糊。我们在中式教育下成长，拥有的独立坚强背后隐藏着难以言喻的伤痛。我的旅行与经历，揭示了中西方教育和家庭观念的巨大差异，这些经历让我对人生和自由有了更深的理解。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">00:02:12</a>:年轻人与长辈的沟通困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">00:06:13</a>:东亚小孩独立坚强的背后</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">00:10:21</a>:接受失败的可能性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="744">00:12:24</a>:《倦怠社会》：自我攻击其实是来自于理想自我和现实自我之间的差距</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="868">00:14:28</a>:被不断入侵的边界！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="956">00:15:56</a>: 为什么不能拥有Gap year？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">00:16:30</a>:为什么不能退学？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1052">00:17:32</a>:逃离中式教育的紧绷，寻找属于自己的人生节奏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">00:20:40</a>:牛马生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1376">00:22:56</a>:坦然接受一切</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1514">00:25:14</a>:《那瓦尔宝典》：勇气不是冲进机关枪窝，勇气是不在乎别人的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 BGM</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Stan —— Eminem</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>I see fire —— Ed Sheeran</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎙️ 主播</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>雷子</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
